leaf-downloader (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging.
  * Vendors yt-dlp 2026.3.17 (pinned, SHA-256 verified at build time)
    into /usr/lib/leaf-downloader/vendor/ to avoid any runtime pip
    installation.
  * Launcher script (bin/leaf-downloader) prepends vendor directory to
    PYTHONPATH at startup so the vendored yt-dlp is found transparently.
  * Declares hard Depends on python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1
    (all available in Ubuntu 22.04 LTS / Jammy and later).
  * Recommends ffmpeg (required only for DASH stream muxing via yt-dlp)
    and gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1 (optional system tray icon).
  * Installs .desktop entry, AppStream metainfo, and hicolor icon set.

 -- Khondokar Shazid Hassan <hasan.psl@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 30 May 2026 07:00:00 +0000
